1
00:00:00,088 --> 00:00:03,850
Start with reviewed cluster-specific configuration files.

2
00:00:04,238 --> 00:00:08,700
Give them clear ordered names and keep the same cluster identity throughout.

3
00:00:09,112 --> 00:00:12,850
Each pipeline step pairs an action with its saved configuration.

4
00:00:13,262 --> 00:00:17,338
Keep passwords in separate credential references rather than in the

5
00:00:17,338 --> 00:00:18,000
files.

6
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,738
Saving a pipeline does not execute it.

7
00:00:21,138 --> 00:00:25,375
Review every file against the installed framework schema before adding

8
00:00:25,375 --> 00:00:26,325
it to the sequence.

9
00:00:27,529 --> 00:00:31,279
Place a required initial administrator password change first.

10
00:00:31,667 --> 00:00:34,992
Use the current credential to authorize it and a separate reference

11
00:00:34,992 --> 00:00:36,254
for the replacement credential.

12
00:00:36,667 --> 00:00:41,129
Verification must establish a fresh authenticated session with the

13
00:00:41,129 --> 00:00:42,104
new password.

14
00:00:42,504 --> 00:00:44,917
Later files must use that replacement reference.

15
00:00:45,317 --> 00:00:49,154
Leave password-change settings unused in later steps so they skip

16
00:00:49,167 --> 00:00:49,742
cleanly.

17
00:00:50,129 --> 00:00:54,454
Never repeat a completed password change simply because a subsequent

18
00:00:54,454 --> 00:00:55,242
step failed.

19
00:00:56,433 --> 00:01:00,396
Use a narrowly reviewed configuration for EULA acceptance and the

20
00:01:00,396 --> 00:01:01,583
approved Pulse setting.

21
00:01:01,983 --> 00:01:06,171
Add the required D N S and N T P settings according

22
00:01:06,171 --> 00:01:07,233
to the installed schema.

23
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,921
Check that later steps can authenticate and reach the cluster after

24
00:01:10,921 --> 00:01:12,508
the initial access changes.

25
00:01:12,896 --> 00:01:17,183
Legal acceptance and telemetry settings are explicit organizational

26
00:01:17,183 --> 00:01:17,908
decisions;

27
00:01:18,308 --> 00:01:22,421
do not treat either as an automatic default for every environment.

28
00:01:23,588 --> 00:01:27,750
Add supported virtual-machine networks, storage containers and any

29
00:01:27,750 --> 00:01:29,838
approved high-availability settings.

30
00:01:30,225 --> 00:01:35,300
Review naming, V LANs, replication and capacity choices against the

31
00:01:35,312 --> 00:01:35,762
design.

32
00:01:36,162 --> 00:01:40,550
Verify the actual returned properties after creation, not only whether

33
00:01:40,550 --> 00:01:41,925
a container name exists.

34
00:01:42,338 --> 00:01:46,325
Additional local administrators use their own credential references

35
00:01:46,550 --> 00:01:47,788
and explicit roles.

36
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:52,225
Check that every optional action is supported by the selected workflow

37
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,462
and target release.

38
00:01:54,642 --> 00:01:58,979
Open Pipelines, create a descriptive name and add the saved actions

39
00:01:59,029 --> 00:02:00,054
in their approved order.

40
00:02:00,467 --> 00:02:03,029
Select the exact file for each step.

41
00:02:03,442 --> 00:02:07,979
Review the password transition, targets and required approvals before

42
00:02:07,992 --> 00:02:08,467
saving.

43
00:02:08,867 --> 00:02:10,617
Steps execute sequentially.

44
00:02:11,029 --> 00:02:12,517
A failure stops later work;

45
00:02:12,904 --> 00:02:15,054
it does not roll back earlier changes.

46
00:02:15,467 --> 00:02:20,492
Approval-mandatory steps may require direct approved execution rather

47
00:02:20,492 --> 00:02:22,192
than unattended pipeline chaining.

48
00:02:23,338 --> 00:02:28,338
After execution, inspect every step and independently read back the

49
00:02:28,350 --> 00:02:29,438
requested settings.

50
00:02:29,850 --> 00:02:33,875
Verify new account access and both requested administrator roles.

51
00:02:34,288 --> 00:02:38,525
Before Prism Central registration, check its connectivity and trust,

52
00:02:38,788 --> 00:02:42,038
then confirm cluster identity and inventory there.

53
00:02:42,438 --> 00:02:46,688
If a step failed, reconcile the partial state and rerun only the

54
00:02:46,700 --> 00:02:48,825
pending action through a supported path.

55
00:02:49,238 --> 00:02:52,762
Preserve the successful jobs and final acceptance evidence.
